## Thank you for purchasing the Essential UI Pack from Viral Templates! ##
To ensure everything works correctly, please follow the installation steps below:

--> Installation <--
1- Locate each folder included in the package.

2- Place every folder into its corresponding Roblox service.
   -- Example: The folder named "ServerScriptService" should be placed inside ServerScriptService in Roblox Studio.
   
3- After placing the folders, ungroup their contents inside the assigned service (right-click → Ungroup, or Ctrl+U).
   -- Important: Place all folders in the correct services BEFORE ungrouping.
   -- Failing to do so may prevent some systems from functioning properly.
   
4- Enable your Security Settings: File → Game Settings → Security → enable all settings.

5- Go to ReplicatedStorage → Configuration and update the IDs, icons, and display text in each ModuleScript to match your game.
   -- Each script includes inline notes explaining what to change.
   
6- Go to ServerScriptService → Services and edit ONLY the following scripts (marked with green text):
   -- DailyRewardsService → RewardFunctions
   -- MarketplaceService → PacksRewards
   -- MarketplaceService → PassesRewards
   -- MarketplaceService → ProductsRewards
   -- PlaytimeRewardsService → RewardFunctions
   -- WheelSpinService → RewardFunctions
   -- Replace the placeholder code with your own reward logic (e.g. giving currency, items, etc.)

